      "content": "how would i even start to check for \"glitches\" in their behavior? like, if they're using a synthetic version of me to talk to them, wouldn't the AI be programmed to hide the seams? i need to know what kind of data patterns or linguistic mismatches i should be looking for to prove they're interacting with a model instead of my actual soul/consciousness.",
